    <string name="cloud_consent_disclosure">When Bidu cannot understand a command offline and cloud reasoning is on, it sends only that command\'s text, the current time, your reply language, the list of Bidu\'s tool names and the names of apps on this phone to the cloud API using your own key. Notes, contacts, reminders and memory are never sent.</string>
